# Urza's Saga: chapter I gives it "{T}: Add {C}" and chapter II "{2}, {T}: Create a 0/0 Construct ..." for good, and
# chapter III searches for an artifact card with mana cost {0} or {1} and puts it onto the battlefield (CR 714.2b).
# Turn 3 (chapter II): two Moxen pay the {2} and the Saga taps, and the Construct counts every artifact Bot1 controls,
# itself included (the Saga is a land): 3/3. Turn 5 (chapter III) fetches Mox Pearl, a {0} artifact, so the Construct
# is 4/4, and the Saga is sacrificed once the chapter has resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Urza's Saga
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Forest x4
Forest x10
Mox Pearl
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Saga.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Saga.Counters.Lore = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Saga.Activate(Ability: Construct)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Construct Token.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Construct Token.Toughness = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Search(Mox Pearl)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Emerald; Mox Pearl; Construct Token

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Emerald; Mox Pearl; Construct Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Construct Token.Power = 4
